  "body": "Per @bzbarsky and @ajklein this is where Location actually lives in\nbrowsers. Changing this in preparation for the cross-origin objects\nrewrite of Location and WindowProxy.\n\nHas https://github.com/annevk/html-cross-origin-objects details on that\nrewrite.\n\nThis fixes\nhttps://github.com/annevk/html-cross-origin-objects/issues/24.\n\n(We should maybe consider moving more concepts to Window. @bzbarsky\nalluded to a wider mismatch between the specification and browsers.)\n",
